+  PARAMS: VDD=1 VSS=0 VTHRESH=0.5
X_U9         CYC_SKIP_INT N16780221 BUF_DELAY_BASIC_GEN PARAMS: VDD=1 VSS=0
+  VTHRESH=0.5 DELAY=25n
C_C2         N01375 VSS  1u  TC=0,0 
.ENDS
*$
.subckt COUNTER_TRY_S2 1 2 3 4  
